{"id": "EUVD-2026-98939", "enisaUuid": "f8c2d89a-d013-3b3f-9811-568e3d20e8c6", "description": "RuoYi-Vue-Plus through 6.0.0 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability that allows authenticated users to delete other users' social login bindings by supplying their socialId. Attackers can send DELETE /auth/unlock/{socialId} requests with a victim's binding id to remove their GitHub, WeChat, or Gitee binding and stored OAuth tokens, blocking social login.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:08", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T22:15:43", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/ruoyi-vue-plus-social-unbind-idor", "https://github.com/dromara/RuoYi-Vue-Plus/blob/7180b529776834fee912113b23f0bd7a387a8222/ruoyi-admin/src/main/java/org/dromara/web/controller/AuthController.java#L156-L162", "https://github.com/dromara/RuoYi-Vue-Plus/blob/7180b529776834fee912113b23f0bd7a387a8222/ruoyi-modules/ruoyi-system/src/main/java/org/dromara/system/service/impl/SysSocialServiceImpl.java#L116-L118", "https://github.com/dromara/RuoYi-Vue-Plus", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/ruoyi-vue-plus-through-6.0.0-idor-via-delete-auth-unlock-socialid"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110106", "GHSA-qv77-x67j-jf7m"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2ba4ec3a-7661-36f5-9cca-56497a8a3832", "product": {"name": "RuoYi-Vue-Plus", "vendor": {"name": "dromara"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22646.0.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "fbd3e52e-374c-3c35-9fe3-c840d06ca83b", "vendor": {"name": "dromara"}}], "isExploited": false}